Device KV lease: prior work
---------------------------
The on-demand Device KV lease (the windowed admission reservation, the growth
in ensure_sequence_kv_lease, the settlement and shortfall API of the Program,
the retained-cache release at the round boundary and the bounded budget) is
adapted from the same fork, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  * Wallawalla47 (Ian Ranson) -- https://github.com/Wallawalla47/ninfer-custom
    (commit 9f108db7, "grow each answer's Device KV lease instead of reserving
    max_tokens"). This tree reclaims through its own eviction order and keeps
    the reservation of an answer that fits its window whole at admission.

